# Party chat test (docs/re-party-chat.md): the menu start site of script 018 (0x0205F350/0x0205F368, menu
# state 0x29). No menu entry reaching it was found, so the menu state is poked to 0x29 from the top menu
# (state 3). Run with --save on a party-chat build.
include boot_from_save
wait 250
exec 0x0205F368 menu_start_018
exec 0x02020188 field_start_018
press X 3
wait 70
shot ms_top
watch u32 0x020B0010 state
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x29
wait 60
shot ms_1
wait 90
shot ms_2
press A 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 60
shot ms_3
press A 3
wait 60
shot ms_4
peek u16 0x020B6BE4 map
dump 0x02204620 0x5C flags_after
